      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尽全力打招呼的莱茵力量。\n被聚在房间里的后冠赛马娘们\n温暖的笑声包裹着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63a7f05b45dffdb642c47b71a85c6ec0b82328e6620b644f1025b688d7cf33e2",
