    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a13ea91101bce755a0ef82e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能聚集这么多的马娘完全是因为……\n莱茵力量通过自己的奔跑建立起了牵绊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fff7d6da1b70d1823ee2cffbc07a950d9382a3e4603db364337c2b377958c278",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
