      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是她用自己的双手……\n出于对后冠路线的热爱和\n对未来的憧憬而引发的奇迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32e8f4e63140adf4f59de12f4e32c7d465654ff82259016d24ed300d7b1fbcbb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
